{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-8","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If between two numbers there fall numbers in continued proportion with them, then, however many numbers fall between them in continued proportion, so many will also fall in continued proportion between the numbers which have the same ratio with the original numbers.","book":8,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","contentId":"euclid-8-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48b66eaacf0c2d77d1a9a1d4c6c2c95b01f9af9a229e11453e208f75b36b33db","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-8.statement","euclid-8-8.construction.1","euclid-8-8.proof.1","euclid-8-8.proof.2","euclid-8-8.proof.3","euclid-8-8.proof.4","euclid-8-8.proof.5","euclid-8-8.proof.6","euclid-8-8.proof.7","euclid-8-8.proof.8","euclid-8-8.proof.9","euclid-8-8.conclusion","euclid-8-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd24105cb55eff0bacadedba8b1129295a2ddd7cb0d7a8b0e8ca45a408efe321","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If between two numbers there fall numbers in continued proportion with them, then, however many numbers fall between them in continued proportion, so many will also fall in continued proportion between the numbers which have the same ratio with the original numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在两个数字之间,连比例个数字与它们相伴,那么,无论在连比例个数字之间有多少数字相伴,那么在连比例个数字之间,同样数字在与原始数字相同的比之间,也会有这么多数字在连比例个数字之间下降。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57f081856eab42843491ff622ed767ec23a5b3beee1ca20fe841148b41c4b600","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the numbers C, D fall between the two numbers A, B in continued proportion with them, and let E be made in the same ratio to F as A is to B; I say that, as many numbers as have fallen between A, B in continued proportion, so many will also fall between E, F in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让C、D数字在连比例的2个数字A、B之间下降,让E数字与A和B的比相同;我说,连比例的A、B和C数字一样多,如此多的数字也将在连比例的E、F之间下降。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4f2f526518f99e8ff02f8a21813138b469f10e47dcae37bf7a8773d73e8cded","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-8-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, as many as A, B, C, D are in multitude, let so many numbers G, H, K, L, the least of those which have the same ratio with A, C, D, B, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] therefore the extremes of them G, L are prime to one another. [[VIII. 3](/principles/euclid-8-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A、B、C、D、D、G、H、K、L,其中比例相同的A、C、B、B最少;因此,其中最极端的是G、L和互素。 [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] [[VIII. 3](/principles/euclid-8-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d50cc1c48edba8dfc5d207a6a448b1aaeb4455ee3a01c69248816cb83697d4bc","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A, C, D, B are in the same ratio with G, H, K, L, and the multitude of the numbers A, C, D, B is equal to the multitude of the numbers G, H, K, L, therefore, ex aequali, as A is to B, so is G to L. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A,C,D,B与G,H,K,L处于相同比例,A,C,D,B与G,L的人数相同,因此,在平等的基础上,A对B的比例等于G对L；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 L 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1484aebbbd11ea943f94c3edc3e0cba1bbb119b31f6be91a7c441c0e174f7943","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is E to F; therefore also, as G is to L, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对B的比等于E对F的比;因此,G对L的比等于E对F的比；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；G 与 L 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd67dbf6e40d2f6d54be5b27636ed37f6748cfa3044fdb0410f4272c5426417a","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G, L are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G,L是初级, 质数也是最低的, 而最小的整除个 , 相同比例的相同次数, 数量越大,数量越小,数量越小, 即, 早前的早, 以及随之而来的结果。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2be071a44c7d66770650d97081a7ca5ad90a466c8b349e5df78076772e1c6c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G measures E the same number of times as L measures F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,G 整除 E 与L 整除 F 倍相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"206143d4e0912968c9aeb70a7f692f2395cd9cf98a6b5d208761bc9cd97b886a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, as many times as G measures E, so many times let H, K also measure M, N respectively; therefore G, H, K, L measure E, M, N, F the same number of times."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 H、K 分别整除 M、N 的次数，都等于 G 整除 E 的次数；于是 G、H、K、L 分别整除 E、M、N、F 的次数相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99194af8c731bbb1a1e37d24662a70fcb6f23d10250524c55f8a51fe01e57b46","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G, H, K, L are in the same ratio with E, M, N, F. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，G、H、K、L 与 E、M、N、F 按对应顺序具有相同的比例。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a7858ad9e4f166901efdaa7b3c55e6c7e004535e31a079145cbb3ad58becbc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G, H, K, L are in the same ratio with A, C, D, B; therefore A, C, D, B are also in the same ratio with E, M, N, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G,H,K,L与A,C,D,B的比相同;因此,A,C,D,B的比与E,M,N,F的比相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0bb0cbe55e3f86183cc73f9c68ee21ab630fff098c4bc7a1086c7868cdfcbd9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, C, D, B are in continued proportion; therefore E, M, N, F are also in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,C,D,B在连比例;因此,E,M,N,F也在连比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f32b991900f867cd4a676c8438206518f4f982bc9f1e08ec73f55e4ee95f5c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as many numbers as have fallen between A, B in continued proportion with them, so many numbers have also fallen between E, F in continued proportion. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在连比例中,人数在A至B之间下降,在连比例中,人数也在E F之间下降。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-8.source","contentId":"euclid-8-8","revisionId":"euclid-8-8@raw-48b66eaacf0c2d77","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de5a80d57b4cff01b15a4772193913eff117e33eae02aef7992fa6f08562db29","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-8:euclid-7-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-8.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VII. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-8:euclid-8-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-8.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-8:euclid-7-14:ex